<title>USA: Glendale Co-Operative approves merger.</title>
<headline>Glendale Co-Operative approves merger.</headline>
<dateline>EVERETT, Mass. 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glendale Co-Operative Bank said that its shareholders have approved MASSBANK Corp's acquisition of Glendal for $28.00 a share cash, or $7.38 million.</p>
</text>
